---
title: sd MF-02b: Affiliate Submits Candidate Referral & Consent Request
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor AF as Affiliate
  participant FE as Web App (HRConnect-FE)
  participant API as JobEndpoints
  participant H as SubmitCandidateCommandHandler
  participant R2 as Cloudflare R2 Storage
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant MAIL as Resend Email Service
  AF->>FE: Enter Candidate info (email, phone) & upload CV PDF
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/jobs/{id}/candidate-submissions
  API->>H: Send(SubmitCandidateCommand)
  H->>R2: Upload validated Affiliate CV PDF
  H->>DB: Match or create Candidate by normalized email / phone
  H->>DB: Check duplicate Submission or pending Consent for this Job
  alt Candidate already submitted or Consent pending
    H->>DB: Insert Submission (BLOCKED_DUPLICATE), preserve first Attribution
    H-->>API: Throw ConflictException (BLOCKED_DUPLICATE)
    API-->>FE: 409 Conflict (Duplicate Referral)
  else First Valid Referral for this Job
    H->>DB: Insert Submission (PENDING_CONSENT) & SubmissionConsent (TokenHash)
    H->>MAIL: Send Consent confirmation email with tokenized link
    H-->>API: Return SubmissionResultDto
    API-->>FE: 201 Created (Awaiting Candidate Consent)
  end
